  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4971c5eb32d68c6419c2b82ec69e3fa3, type: 3}
  m_Name: WorkerSuspicious
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: WorkerSuspicious
  dialogueLines:
  - The player spoke to the employee again. And again. The narrator was beginning
    to suspect this was intentional.
  - The player spoke to the employee again. Surely they remembered doing this already.
    Surely.
  - The player spoke to the employee again. The narrator was starting to notice a
    pattern.
  - The player spoke to the employee again. And once more for good measure. Interesting.
  - "The player spoke to the employee again. The narrator was beginning to think
    this wasn\u2019t an accident."
  - Again, the player spoke to the employee. At this point, repetition seemed to
    be the goal.
  - The player spoke to the employee. Then spoke to them again. The narrator was
    becoming suspicious.
  - The player had another conversation with the employee. The narrator wondered
    if they were doing this on purpose.
  - The player spoke to the employee again. And again. There was definitely a pattern
    forming.
  - Once again, the player approached the employee. The narrator was beginning to
    run out of excuses for them.
  - The player spoke to the employee again. The narrator was starting to suspect
    this was less curiosity and more persistence.
  - Another interaction. With the same employee. Again. The narrator was taking note.
  - The player spoke to the employee yet again. Surely this was deliberate by now.
  - The player returned to the employee for another conversation. The narrator was
    beginning to see what was happening.
  - Again, the player spoke to the employee. The narrator was starting to question
    their intentions.
  - The player spoke to the employee. Then did it again. And again. This was becoming
    difficult to ignore.
  - The player had another chat with the employee. The narrator was beginning to
    suspect they enjoyed pressing that button.
  - The player spoke to the employee once more. The narrator was beginning to think
    they had discovered a new hobby.
  - The player interacted with the employee again. The narrator was now fairly certain
    this was intentional.
  - The player spoke to the employee again. At this point, the narrator was less
    curious about why and more curious about how long this would continue.
  canRepeat: 1
  priority: 3
